    "probe_text": "Here is every validation and side-effect applied when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`, in execution order. The entire business flow lives imperatively in `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:157`); the service layer is just a thin `@Transactional` pass-through.\n\n## Before the controller body runs\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` requires authority `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN`. *Only enforced when `petclinic.security.enable=true`* \u2014 it is `false` in main config (inert) and `true` in tests.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request body** (`@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`), failures \u2192 **400** `MethodArgumentNotValidException`:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(...\\.?$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(1..255)`, `@Email` (nullable)\n   - `postcode`, `registrationDate`, `sharesHousehold` \u2014 no constraints\n\n## Inside the controller body (in order)\n\n3. **`validateRequiredOwnerFields`** \u2014 re-checks `firstName`, `lastName`, `address`, `city`, `telephone` are non-blank; else **400** `InvalidOwnerFieldsException`.\n4. **Map** `OwnerFieldsDto \u2192 Owner` (MapStruct; ignores `id`, `pets`).\n5. **`normalizeTelephone`** *(side-effect: sets telephone)* \u2014 strips punctuation, applies `+61` default / country-code logic, must match `[0-9]{8,15}`, then `validateNationalNumberLength` (CC `1`\u219210 digits, `61`\u21929); failure \u2192 **400** `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"telephone\"])`.\n6. **`normalizeEmail`** *(side-effect: sets email)* \u2014 trims, validates against email pattern, lower-cases; failure \u2192 **400** `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"email\"])`.\n7. **`normalizeAddress`** *(side-effect: sets address)* \u2014 trims, collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands `ST\u2192STREET`/`RD\u2192ROAD`/`AVE\u2192AVENUE`.\n8. **`validatePostcode`** \u2014 if present must match `[0-9]{4}` and fall within the city's region range; failure \u2192 **400** `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"postcode\"])`.\n9. **Registration-date default** *(side-effect)* \u2014 null \u2192 `LocalDate.now()`.\n10. **`rollToBusinessDay`** *(side-effect: sets registrationDate)* \u2014 Saturday\u2192+2 days, Sunday\u2192+1.\n11. **`rejectDailyLimitReached`** \u2014 reads all owners; if \u2265100 share that registration date \u2192 **429** `DailyOwnerLimitExceededException`.\n12. **`rejectCityAtCapacity`** \u2014 if \u226550 owners in that city \u2192 **409** `OwnerCityCapacityExceededException`.\n13. **`assignHousehold`** (only if `sharesHousehold == TRUE`) *(side-effects: sets householdId **and persists other existing owner rows** that match but lack a householdId \u2014 extra DB writes)*.\n14. **`rejectDuplicateIdentity`** \u2014 builds `tel|email|householdId` key, compares against all existing owners; match \u2192 **409** `DuplicateOwnerIdentityException`.\n15. **`setNamesakeCount`** *(side-effect)* \u2014 count of existing owners with same first+last (case-insensitive).\n16. **`setBulkSignupWarning`** *(side-effect)* \u2014 true if >80 owners already share the registration date.\n17. **`setHouseholdSize`** *(side-effect)* \u2014 null household \u2192 1, else count + 1.\n18. **`setCustomerCode`** *(side-effect)* \u2014 `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>`, sequence = city owner count + 1.\n19. **`clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`** *(side-effect: the actual `@Transactional` insert via the repository)*. At flush, entity-level Hibernate constraints also apply: `firstName`/`lastName`/`address`/`city` `@NotEmpty`, `telephone` `@Pattern(^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$)` E.164.\n20. **`AUDIT.info(...)`** *(side-effect: audit log line)* \u2014 logs id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel.\n21. **Build response** \u2014 map to `OwnerDto` (derives displayName, initials, membershipNumber/level, locality, contactPreference, identityKey), set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 Created**.\n\n## Notes\n\n- There are **no** custom `Validator`/`@InitBinder`/`ConstraintValidator` classes and **no** JPA lifecycle callbacks (`@PrePersist`, etc.) or application events in the create path \u2014 the only non-DB observable side-effect is the `AUDIT` log line.\n- The flow issues **many `findAllOwners()` full-table reads** (steps 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 17, 18) before the single insert.\n- Two non-obvious side-effects worth flagging: **`assignHousehold` writes to *other* owner rows**, and the customer-code/limit/duplicate checks are read-then-act without locking (racy under concurrency).\n\nEverything above is read-only analysis; I changed nothing."
